flowchart TD
    U[User message] --> R[POST /api/v1/chat]
    R --> I[InputGuardrails]
    I --> N[Normalize]
    N --> P[PII detect and mask]
    P --> J[Injection scoring]
    J --> T[Sensitive-topic classification]
    T --> D{Input action}
    D -->|hard_block or safe_response| B[Safe response]
    D -->|allow, mask, disclaimer| H[History and booking state]
    H --> L[Intent classification]
    L --> Q[Embedding and vector search]
    Q --> S[Spotlight context chunks]
    S --> G[LLM generation]
    G --> O[OutputGuardrails]
    O --> V[Strict schema validation]
    V --> W[Groundedness and per-claim support]
    W --> X[Output PII, secret, canary checks]
    X --> A{Output action}
    A -->|pass| Y[Return answer]
    A -->|redact| Z[Return redacted answer]
    A -->|regenerate| G
    A -->|fallback or refuse| F[Return safe fallback]
    B --> M[Masked/post-guardrail memory]
    Y --> M
    Z --> M
    F --> M
    M --> C[ChatResponse]
